title: "LLM-Informed Explainable AI for Software Defect Prediction: Reproducibility Package"
type: software
version: "1.0-reproducibility"
date-released: 2026-09-24
authors:
  - name: "Anonymous Authors"
keywords:
  - explainable artificial intelligence
  - software defect prediction
  - large language models
  - reproducibility
  - LIME
