abstract: >-
  Reproducibility package for an empirical study comparing traditional and
  matched LLM-informed explanation methods for software defect prediction,
  including RQ1-RQ6 configurations, code, study data, archived outputs,
  aggregated statistics, and a separate full artifact containing frozen
  predictors and complete RQ5/RQ6 shard outputs.
